{"ticker":"NWS","updated":"2026-10-23T23:24:30Z","profile":{"longName":"News Corporation","shortName":"News Corporation","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Entertainment","country":"United States","website":"https://www.newscorp.com","fullTimeEmployees":21700,"marketCap":18190266368,"trailingPE":32.786407,"forwardPE":22.338795,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.0148723,"pegRatio":3.05,"targetMeanPrice":null,"targetHighPrice":null,"targetLowPrice":null,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":null,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.108,"earningsGrowth":-0.749,"grossMargins":0.57167,"operatingMargins":0.12537,"profitMargins":0.06347,"totalRevenue":9027999744,"beta":0.976,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":35.76,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":25.49,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.59},"summary":"News Corporation, a media and information services company, creates and distributes authoritative and engaging content, and other products and services for consumers and businesses in the United States, Canada, Europe, Australasia, and internationally. It operates through five segments: Dow Jones, Digital Real Estate Services, Book Publishing, News Media, and Other. The company distributes news, data, and business information under The Wall Street Journal, Barron's, MarketWatch, Investor's Business Daily, Dow Jones Risk & Compliance, Dow Jones Energy, Factiva, and Dow Jones Newswires brands through various media channels, including websites, mobile apps, newspapers, newswires, newsletters, magazines, proprietary databases, live journalism, video, and podcasts. It also provides property and property-related services on its websites and mobile apps, such as realestate.com.au, realcommercial.com.au, Flatmates.com.au, and property portals, as well as residential, commercial, and share property websites; mortgage broking offering and property-related data services to the financial sector; and Realtor.com, RealPRO Select, Connections Plus, Listing Toolkit products, RealChoice Selling, and Realtor.com +. In addition, the company publishes and distributes consumer books comprising general fiction, nonfiction, and children and religious publishing through print and digital formats under","summary_zh":"新聞集團是一家媒體和資訊服務公司，為美國、加拿大、歐洲、澳洲和國際上的消費者和企業創建和分發權威且引人入勝的內容以及其他產品和服務。它透過五個部門運作：道瓊斯、數位房地產服務、書籍出版、新聞媒體和其他。該公司透過各種媒體管道（包括網站、行動應用程式、報紙、新聞專線、時事通訊、雜誌、專有資料庫、現場新聞、視訊和播客）以《華爾街日報》、《巴倫周刊》、《MarketWatch》、《投資者商業日報》、《道瓊斯風險與合規》、道瓊斯能源、Factiva 和瓊斯瓊斯品牌。它還在其網站和行動應用程式上提供房地產和房地產相關服務，例如 realestate.com.au、realcommercial.com.au、Flatmates.com.au 和房地產入口網站，以及住宅、商業和共享房地產網站；為金融部門提供抵押貸款經紀服務和與房地產相關的數據服務；以及 Realtor.com、RealPRO Select、Connections Plus、Listing 和與房地產相關的數據服務；此外，該公司還透過印刷和數位格式出版和發行消費書籍，包括普通小說、非小說以及兒童和宗教出版。","sector_zh":"通訊服務","industry_zh":"娛樂","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":35.15,"h":35.24,"l":34.65,"c":34.71,"v":617400},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":34.68,"h":34.68,"l":34.22,"c":34.29,"v":488200},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":34.22,"h":34.49,"l":34.06,"c":34.11,"v":420100},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":34.28,"h":34.47,"l":33.89,"c":34.05,"v":501900},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":34.01,"h":34.09,"l":33.7,"c":33.87,"v":595800},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":33.53,"h":33.64,"l":33.02,"c":33.21,"v":508100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":32.98,"h":33.24,"l":31.97,"c":32.89,"v":1494100},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":33.03,"h":33.28,"l":32.85,"c":33.17,"v":685200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":33.07,"h":33.71,"l":32.67,"c":33.4,"v":378800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":33.41,"h":34.07,"l":33.12,"c":33.97,"v":557100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":32.75,"h":33.01,"l":32.34,"c":32.45,"v":9093800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":32.35,"h":32.4,"l":31.56,"c":31.56,"v":1851700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":31.7,"h":32.37,"l":31.66,"c":32.27,"v":3981500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":32.21,"h":32.47,"l":32.06,"c":32.27,"v":1197000},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":32.45,"h":32.88,"l":32.31,"c":32.85,"v":2043900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":32.79,"h":32.98,"l":32.5,"c":32.8,"v":1975000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":32.79,"h":33.38,"l":32.6,"c":33.15,"v":2510500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":33.46,"h":33.82,